,"id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-15T18:08:25Z","updated_at":"2026-07-15T18:08:25Z","body":"> I believe this commit has caused this issue: [Broken rigidbody2d behavior after 4.7 update #120671](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120671)\r\n\r\nIt seems to be the same problem as with #121038. I wrote up a more thorough investigation [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120671#issuecomment-4983705329). To sum up, this shouldn't have worked in the first place, and only did work due to what seems like a `CanvasItem` bug.\r\n\r\nIf a bunch more similar reports show up we might have to do something about this, but for now the corrections to the user code have been fairly straight-forward, and I would argue probably needed for other reasons as well.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4983829028/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4987300415